                                    <div role="main" id="mc-main-content">
                                        <h1 class="script-category">Open Menu Item script steps</h1>
                                        <p>Open Menu Item script steps open specific FileMaker&#160;Pro dialog boxes as if you had chosen the command from a menu. You could use one of these script steps to open a dialog box for users if you have restricted their access to FileMaker&#160;Pro menus with access privileges.</p>
